  "metadata": {
    "name": "Cell \u2014 PLACENAV ROUTE test (relocate-on-eat forces map routing) + turn_brake=0",
    "description": "PlaceNav isolation: the reframed planner (NAVIGATE the map to a LOOSE food-region tag). food_alternate: ONE food hopping between 2 FIXED spots on each eat; spawn ON the first spot so the tag seeds at t~0. After eating, the food relocates to the other remembered spot -> the bug MUST route there by the shared place-map (camping impossible). Loose bounded tag with honest on-arrival forget: slight food motion within a region no longer breaks it, but a vanished cache collapses. Gate: distributed eats over time (routing) vs clustered (stumble). Open 24m arena.",
